     editable columns as the data-entry reports. Deployed separately from
     package.xml because they are only worth having once the two Winter '27
     list-view inline-editing settings are switched on (see README), and so a
     column-name mismatch here can never block the core report deploy.
     Nothing else in the package depends on these. -->
